# Secrets
.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
main.pdf

# workspace 是本地工作产物(brief/input/draft/final/跨章状态…)。
# 文件夹本身用 .gitkeep 保留,但里面跑出来的东西不进版本库——它们是 --init / 流水线
# 的产物,不是源代码。.gitkeep 例外,它让空目录能被 git 跟踪。
workspace/**
!workspace/.gitkeep

# User experiment data is local and often large — keep the contract, not the payload.
# Comment the next lines out if you want results committed.
data/**
!data/README.md
!data/*.example.*

# The idea document is the author's unpublished contribution — keep the template,
# not the content. Comment this out if the repo is private and you want it tracked.
idea.md

# Outline 文件:草稿、中英双轨产物都是用户输入/运行时生成,不进版本库。
# 模板 outline.example.md 进。
outline_draft.md
outline.md
outline.zh.md

# 文献检索候选清单(--retrieve 产物):自动检索、未经核实,不进版本库。
# 模板与正式引用库 references/bibliography.md 仍进版本库。
references/candidates.md

# 项目状态文档(PROJECT.md / PROGRESS.md):本地开发用,不进版本库。
PROJECT.md
PROGRESS.md
